sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor User
participant AuthController
participant RegisterUserService
participant UserRepository as IUserRepository / MongoUserRepository
participant PasswordHasher as PasswordHasher / BcryptPasswordHasher
participant UserAggregate as User aggregate
participant TokenService as TokenService / JwtTokenService

User->>AuthController: POST /auth/register
AuthController->>RegisterUserService: execute(command)
RegisterUserService->>UserRepository: findByEmail(Email.create(email))
UserRepository-->>RegisterUserService: null
RegisterUserService->>PasswordHasher: hash(password)
PasswordHasher-->>RegisterUserService: passwordHash
RegisterUserService->>UserAggregate: User.create(props)
UserAggregate-->>RegisterUserService: user
RegisterUserService->>UserRepository: save(user)
UserRepository-->>RegisterUserService: void
RegisterUserService->>TokenService: generateToken({ sub, email })
TokenService-->>RegisterUserService: accessToken
RegisterUserService-->>AuthController: AuthenticationResult
AuthController-->>User: 201 { access_token }
